WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
08:10 — Today pick. Hira opens Today on her phone — weather first, then a bottle suggestion she can accept or ignore in under a minute.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
08:20 — Bottle confirm. Bottle detail on the phone before it goes in the bag; notes from last wear stop her guessing in the hallway mirror.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
18:00 — iPad collection. Evening iPad browse through the collection feels like opening the cupboard without standing in front of it forever.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
21:00 — Laptop notes. Occasion notes on the laptop capture weddings and office days so next time is not a blank memory.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:30 — Calendar. Wear calendar on the laptop shows the week; she closes it knowing the decision took two minutes, not fifteen.

